(267: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20The%20portable-core%20checker.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Resolves%20names%2C%20checks%20types%2C%20and%20fixes%20the%20exact%20operator%20semantics%20of%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20surface%20program%20produced%20by%20one%20of%20the%20language%20frontends.%20The%20result%20is%0A%2F%2F%21%20the%20portable-core%20program%20the%20emitters%20consume%3A%20every%20expression%20carries%0A%2F%2F%21%20its%20type%20and%20every%20operator%20carries%20the%20source%20language%27s%20semantics%2C%20so%20a%0A%2F%2F%21%20target%20can%20never%20silently%20substitute%20its%20own%20%28for%20example%2C%20Lean%27s%20Euclidean%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60Int%60%20division%20for%20JavaScript%27s%20truncating%20%60BigInt%60%20division%29.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Fcheck.js%60%2C%20including%20the%20order%20in%20which%20fresh%0A%2F%2F%21%20names%20are%20drawn%2C%20so%20both%20runtimes%20produce%20the%20same%20checked%20program.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BHashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adecimal%3A%3ADecimal%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adiagnostics%3A%3A%7BResult%2C%20TranslationError%2C%20type_error%2C%20unsupported%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Air%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20Binder%2C%20ByZero%2C%20Case%2C%20Comparison%2C%20Ctor%2C%20DataDecl%2C%20Decl%2C%20Effect%2C%20Expr%2C%20Field%2C%20FnDecl%2C%20Hints%2C%0A%20%20%20%20Item%2C%20LitValue%2C%20Main%2C%20Node%2C%20Param%2C%20Pattern%2C%20Plan%2C%20Program%2C%20Proof%2C%20Prop%2C%20Semantics%2C%20TheoremDecl%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Aproof%3A%3A%7BProofContext%2C%20ProofName%2C%20TheoremHead%2C%20normalise_proof%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Asurface%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20BinaryOp%2C%20External%2C%20Flavor%2C%20Rounding%2C%20SArrayItem%2C%20SCase%2C%20SCasePattern%2C%20SEffect%2C%20SExpr%2C%20SItem%2C%0A%20%20%20%20SMain%2C%20SNode%2C%20SPattern%2C%20SPatternNode%2C%20SProgram%2C%20SProp%2C%20SPropNode%2C%20SRow%2C%20ShowStyle%2C%20Unary